          - spisok polej dolven ukazywatxsq w skobkah;

   BAD VARIANT
          - nedopustimyj wariant;

   DUPLICATE FIELD NAME
          - powtorno ispolxzuetsq imq dlq polq zapisi;

   BAD CONSTANT
          - nedopustimaq konstanta;

   LABEL NOT DECLARED
          - ispolxzuetsq neopredelennaq metka;

   LABEL REDEFINITION
          - pereopredelenie metki nedopustimo;

   LABEL DEFINED AT WRONG LEVEL
          - opredelenie metki na neprawilxnom urowne;

   UNDEFINED SYMBOL
          - neopredelennyj simwol;

   MISSING SEMI-COLON
          - propu}ena ";";

   INVALID DECLARATION. PROBABLY MISSING END
          - nedoputimyj operator;  wozmovno,  ~to  propu}eno
            "END";

   INVALID SYMBOL
          - nedopustimyj simwol;

   NOT IMPLEMENTED
          - dannaq wozmovnostx ne realizowana w kompilqtore;

   MISSING LABEL
          - propu}ena metka;

   BAD 'EXIT'
          - propu}eno "EXIT";

   DUPLICATE CASE LABEL
          - powtorno ispolxzuetsq metka w operatore "CASE";

   ELSE NOT LAST IN CASE STMT
          - "ELSE" ne nahoditsq w konce operatora "CASE";

   MISSING END IN CASE STMT
          - propu}eno "END" w operatore "CASE";

   BAD CASE LABEL
          - nedopustimaq metka wybora w operatore "CASE";

   MISSING UNTIL
          - propu}eno "UNTIL";

   BAD FOR STATEMENT
          - neprawilxnyj format operatora cikla "FOR";

   BAD WITH STATEMENT
          - nedopustimyj operator "WITH";

   WITH IN REG 0
          - dlq operatora "WITH" ispolxzuetsq registr 0;

   TOO MANY ARGUMENTS
          - sli{kom mnogo argumentow;

   BAD ARGUMENT
          - nedopustimyj argument;

   TOO FEW ARGUMENTS
          - ukazano malo argumentow;

   NEW OR DISPOSE ARG NOT POINTER TYPE
          - w   procedurah   "NEW"   i    "DISPOSE"    movet
            ispolxzowatxsq tolxko peremennaq-ukazatelx;

   BAD READ STATEMENT
          - nedopustimyj operator "READ";

   BAD WRITE STATEMENT
          - nedopustimyj operator "WRITE";

   FORMAT MUST BE INTEGER TYPE
          - dlq   ukazaniq    parametrow    formata    mogut
            ispolxzowatxsq tolxko  celo~islennye  peremennye
            ili konstanty;

   FILE VARIABLE MISSING
          - propu}ena peremennaq fajla;

   BAD FILE NAME
          - nedopustimoe imq fajla;

   ILLEGAL ASSIGNMENT
          - nedopustimoe priswaiwanie;

   BAD EXPRESSION
          - o{ibka w wyravenii;

   MISSING ')'
          - propu}ena ")";

   MISSING OPERATOR
          - propu}en operator;

   MISSING OPERAND
          - propu}en operand;

   STRANGE '[' -- BAD SET OR MISSING ARRAY DEF
          - strannoe poqwlenie "[", ~to movet bytx swqzano s
            nedopustimym   mnovestwom   ili   neopredelennym
            massiwom;

   UNDEFINED OPERAND -- ASSUMING INTEGER
          - neopredelennyj operand;  kompilqtor  priswaiwaet
            emu tip "INTEGER";

   FUNCTION ARGUMENT MISSING
          - propu}en argument funkcii;

   FUNCTION ARG MUST BE REAL OR INTEGER
          - argument funkcii dolven  imetx  tip  "REAL"  ili
            "INTEGER";

   ARGUMENT MUST BE INTEGER TYPE
          - argument dolven imetx tip "INTEGER";

   ARG MUST BE REAL
          - sleduet ispolxzowatx argument tipa "REAL";

   ARG MUST BE INTEGER
          - sleduet ispolxzowatx argument tipa "INTEGER";

   ARG MUST BE NON-REAL SCALAR
          - argument  dolven   imetx   skalqrnyj   tip,   ne
            qwlq`}ijsq "REAL";

   BAD 'ABS' ARG
