   BAD SET ELEMENT
          - nedopustimyj |lement mnovestwa;

   MISSING FIELD VARIABLE
          - propu}eno ukazanie polq zapisi;

   UNDEFINED POINTER BASE TYPE
          - neopredelennyj   tip,   na   kotoryj   ssylaetsq
            peremennaq ukazatelx;

   BAD INDEX TYPE
          - nedopustimyj tip indeksa;

   ILLEGAL OPERATOR
          - nedopustimyj operator;

   ILLEGAL TYPE OF OPERAND
          - nedopustimyj tip operanda;

   INCOMPATIBLE ARRAYS
          - nesowmestimye massiwy;

   BAD 'IN' OPERANDS
          - nedopustimye operandy dlq operatora "IN";

   OUT OF FLOATING AC'S
          - dlq    wypolneniq    programmy    ne     hwataet
            akkumulqtorow   processora   plawa`}ej   zapqtoj
